    "mhc.coeff_predict_ffn": String.raw`\begin{aligned}z&=\operatorname{vec}(X'),\\ r&=(\operatorname{mean}(z^2)+\varepsilon_{\mathrm{norm}})^{-1/2},\\ m&=W_H^{\mathrm{ffn}}zr,\\ A&=\sigma(s_Am_A+b_A)+\varepsilon_{\mathrm{hc}},\\ C&=2\sigma(s_Cm_C+b_C),\\ U&=s_Bm_B+b_B,\\ \widetilde B&=\operatorname{softmax}_{\mathrm{row}}(U)+\varepsilon_{\mathrm{hc}},\\ B&=\operatorname{Sinkhorn}_{20}(\widetilde B).\end{aligned}`,
